---
import Chart from "./Chart.astro";
import chart from "../../assets/charts/stage-promotion-dark.svg";
---

<section class="wrap section" id="stages">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Stages</p>
    <h2 class="title">From a commit to PROD, built once.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      A change is built once into an immutable project revision, activated in DEV, tested, approved, then activated
      unchanged in PROD. PROD never rebuilds, and no data is copied between stages.
    </p>
  </div>
  <Chart
    src={chart}
    alt="Stage promotion: a merged pull request is built once, pinned by digest, into one project revision, which is activated in the DEV namespace, tested, approved, and then activated unchanged in PROD"
  />
</section>
